<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Abercrombie raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Abercrombie raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said it raised Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co to buy from long-term buy &quot;based on the stock's current valuation relative to its high-growth peer group.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/8 to 15-1/8.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Maura Hunter Byrne said she expects the company to post a fiscal first quarter loss of $0.02 a share when it reports earnings on May 19.</p>
</text>
